{
  "bookId": "hero-211014",
  "id": "bond-38805",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38805001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "唔，怎么回事，四肢不酸痛了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "而且睁眼就是一片花田，这里究竟是……完全想不起来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "是天国。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "欸欸——！我已经死了吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "开玩笑的。|101|似乎是因为周六熬夜导致的疲惫，在草地上睡着了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38805007",
              "text": "菲伊的表情完全看不出来是在开玩笑呢……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38805007",
              "text": "要是表情能更像开玩笑就好了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38805006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我会将此事提上学习日程。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "话说回来，我记得我睡着的时候周围都还是花苞，现在居然都已经盛开了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是菲伊做了什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我什么也没做，是自然规律，一整天已经足够让花朵们全部绽放。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我反而没想到，|101|的睡眠质量这么好，24小时都没有醒来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "真是值得研究的样本。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38805014",
              "text": "哈哈，菲伊的这个玩笑很有意思哦。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38805014",
              "text": "菲伊这不是很会开玩笑嘛？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38805013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……？这不是玩笑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "今，今天周几……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "周一。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我的周末啊——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38805019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "周日消失了——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
